"aboutFeaturesText": "• Secure account creation (first name, last name, email)\n• Personalized and smart grocery lists\n• Add items with quantity, price and store\n• Automatic calculation of totals and percentages\n• Real-time marking of purchased items\n• Quick duplication of existing lists\n• Secure sharing via links with permissions\n• Rights management (read, edit, administration)\n• Synchronization across all your devices\n• Modern and intuitive interface",
